 * top-layer (anchor-css) branch, so it is not reliably a descendant of the trigger
 * root. Every rule is STANDALONE on the panel's own class, which it carries alongside
 * `data-part='surface'` — a SELF-CARRYING scope element, so the panel's own rules take
