        UA [popover] rules paint `border: solid` and clip via `overflow: auto`;
        this surface owns neither default. `data-ds-position-strategy` is stamped by
        the engine alongside data-part. ---- */
.rottay-popover--rustic[data-part='surface'][data-ds-position-strategy='anchor-css'] {
  border: 0;
  overflow: visible;
