 * migration) rather than relying on a `.rottay-layout[data-part='root']`
 * ancestor that may not exist. `Content` gained its own pair in K3-C
 * (`rottay-layout-content rottay-layout-content--modern`) when its structure
 * moved here from engine utilities.
