 * INLINE-RECOVERY ADDENDUM: Box shares this engine-level layout skin. Its
 * engine pair plus `data-radius` / `data-shadow` selects the same token values
 * that the engine previously assigned inline; caller inline style still wins.
 *
 * K3-C ADDENDUM (pass 1): the shell STRUCTURE moved here from the modern
 * engine's Tailwind utilities (`flex flex-col min-h-screen`, `md:flex-row`,
 * `px-4`, `p-4`, `shrink-0`, `overflow-y-auto`, `transition-all
