 * parity-transcribed: 100vh min block size, the 768px `md` breakpoint,
 * spacing via the density-scaled `--ds-spacing-*` channels, and the sider
 * collapse motion rides the canonical `--ds-motion-slow` (320ms, the canon
 * neighbor of the drained `duration-300`). `Content` now carries
