 * moved from the raw `--ds-surface-panel`/`--ds-surface-card` +
 * `--ds-color-text-primary` channels to the governed `chrome.layout.siderBg`
 * + material panel/card channels (see the sider rules' comment). Header and
 * footer keep `--ds-surface-inset`: measured coherent on both governed
 * sources (TMM #FBF3E7 with #2E261C ink), so they are not in scope.
