 * lives in the rustic skin (Sider's light-theme `border-right`), not here --
 * modern's Sider never sets a border. Every declaration below is non-border
 * (`background`, `color`) and clears preflight unlayered at (0,3,0); each
 * part's own two-class pair + `[data-part='...']` already reaches it.
