/* ---- outlined: transparent fill, and the variant's hue becomes the frame and
        the ink. The bare rule again carries the map's `default` fallback.

        CONTRAST LAW (R0/Axe round 3): on transparent fills the raw hue is the
        TEXT, so it must clear AA on the page surface itself. Bithire's recipe
        profile renders outlined by default, and raw hues fail there (success
        #327CA8 = 4.3:1 on #F4F8FB, warning #D6A04E = 2.4:1). The inks deepen
