 *
 * DELIBERATELY UNLAYERED (P-47): every `rottay-*` layer sorts before Tailwind's
 * base layer, so a layered rule loses to preflight regardless of specificity.
 * Unlayered outranks preflight and still yields to a caller's inline `style`.
 *
 * SINGLE PAINT OWNER (K3-A). The engine no longer emits the DaisyUI
 * `timeline` / `timeline-start` / `timeline-middle` / `timeline-end` classes,
 * so this file now owns EVERY painted and geometric channel of the component:
 * the item grid (a direction-aware re-implementation of the DaisyUI
